ook:Peanut|peanuts]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#[[Cookbook:Whisk|Whisk]] sauce ingredients together in small bowl.\n#In the same pan, heat 2 tbsp oil on medium heat. [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] the frozen edamame beans for 2–3 minutes until cooked.\n#Add the rice and sauce and [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|toss]]. Then add in the shredded carrots and peanuts and fry for 2–3 more minutes. Then serve. \n\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes for fried rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using soy sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peanut]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peanut butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using corn syrup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using golden syrup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Thai Peanut Fried Rice (Vegan)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 tbsp soy sauce","sourceText":"1 tbsp soy sauce","amountText":"1 tbsp soy sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tbsp water","sourceText":"1 tbsp water","amountText":"1 tbsp water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 tsp golden syrup or corn syrup","sourceText":"2 tsp golden syrup or corn syrup","amountText":"2 tsp golden syrup or corn syrup","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 tsp peanut butter","sourceText":"2 tsp peanut butter","amountText":"2 tsp peanut butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tbsp vegan Thai red curry paste (i.e. Thai Taste brand red curry paste)","sourceText":"1 tbsp vegan Thai red curry paste (i.e. Thai Taste brand red curry paste)","amountText":"1 tbsp vegan Thai red curry paste (i.e. Thai Taste brand red curry paste)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 tbsp Chinese black vinegar","sourceText":"1 tbsp Chinese black vinegar","amountText":"1 tbsp Chin